  },
  "columns": [
    "88–92",
    "Nothing happens at the chosen point of origin. Instead, a stream of 1d4 × 10 gems, each worth I GP, shoots from the wand&#x27;s tip in a Line 30 feet long and 5 feet wide toward the chosen point of origin. Each gem deals I Bludgeoning damage, and the total damage of the gems is divided equally among all creatures in the Line."
  ],
